{
  "about": "Everything the required Validate check runs, in the order it runs: static (format, docs, terminology, typecheck, lint first, so most failures show within minutes; the repository guards run with the unit tests), unit, build, browser. `pnpm check` runs exactly this list locally; `pnpm check:quick` runs the fast group, which the pre-push hook runs. Nightly and weekly run on a schedule. `seconds` is the usual time on a GitHub runner. Edit this list, not the workflow, to add or remove a check. The mobile group is parked while mobile is paused (plans/MOBILE_LATER.md): it is outside the gate and runs on demand with `pnpm check:mobile`, against a test build, which keeps the touch controls.",
  "gate": [
    "static",
    "unit",
    "build",
    "browser"
  ],
  "groups": {
    "fast": [
      {
        "id": "format",
        "run": "node scripts/format.mjs --check --changed",
        "seconds": 24
      },
      {
        "id": "docs",
        "run": "node scripts/check-docs.mjs",
        "seconds": 1
      },
      {
        "id": "terminology",
        "run": "node scripts/check-terminology.mjs",
        "seconds": 6
      },
      {
        "id": "repository-guards",
